// main.bicepparam.prod — production environment parameter values.
// Deploy: az deployment group create \
//   --resource-group rg-teetime-prod \
//   --template-file infra/bicep/main.bicep \
//   --parameters @infra/bicep/main.bicepparam.prod
//
// See: infra/AZURE_PLAN.md §4 (parameter strategy), §10.2 (deploy workflow),
//      §12 (open questions)

using 'main.bicep'

// TODO(M-azure-T0): fill in actual values. See AZURE_PLAN.md §12.
param envName = 'prod'
param location = 'eastus2'

// TODO(M-azure-T6): update on each prod release. Pin to explicit image tag,
// not :latest, in prod. Format: <acrLoginServer>/teetime:<semver>
// AZURE_PLAN.md §10.2 — image tag is the release artifact.
param containerImage = 'PLACEHOLDER_ACR_LOGIN_SERVER/teetime:PLACEHOLDER_VERSION'

// Budget params are NOT set here. budget.bicep is subscription-scoped and
// deployed separately. See AZURE_PLAN.md §9.2.

param acrSku = 'Basic'
param kvSku = 'standard'
